A niche hashtag is a specific hashtag used by a smaller, focused group of people. A broad hashtag is used by huge numbers of people.

Using ghee as the example:

Broad: #food, #healthyfood, #ghee. Millions of posts use these, so your post gets buried within minutes.
Niche: #a2ghee, #bilonaghee, #desighee. Far fewer posts use them, but the people who search them want exactly that product. Your post stays visible longer and reaches the right buyers.